{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_g_07.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_g_07.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_01",
      "hash64": "C719B32A85A17CD3",
      "text": "Bonjour ! Il est l’heure de ranger vos\\ntéléphones et de commencer le cours.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_02",
      "hash64": "C719B42A85A17E86",
      "text": "Je me rends compte que jusqu’à présent,\\nje ne vous ai quasiment parlé que de nourriture.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_03",
      "hash64": "C719B52A85A18039",
      "text": "Je crois néanmoins qu’il n’est pas trop tard pour\\nenfin aborder le thème de l’habillement.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_04",
      "hash64": "C719B62A85A181EC",
      "text": "Comme vous le savez, notre académie est\\nrelativement libérale en la matière.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_05",
      "hash64": "C719B72A85A1839F",
      "text": "L’académie propose en effet un uniforme\\npar saison, afin de s’adapter aux nombreuses\\r\\nvariations de climat de Paldea.\\c\\nMais les élèves sont libres de porter l’uniforme\\nqu’ils souhaitent quand ils le veulent.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 211,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_06",
      "hash64": "C719B82A85A18552",
      "text": "Lors de votre arrivée ici, vous avez tous reçu\\nquatre tenues différentes, dont les pièces\\r\\nsont appropriées pour chaque saison.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_07",
      "hash64": "C719B92A85A18705",
      "text": "Si vous ne savez pas où les trouver, je vous invite\\nà vérifier votre garde-robe.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_08",
      "hash64": "C719BA2A85A188B8",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, sachez que seul le port\\nde l’uniforme est imposé par l’académie.\\r\\nVous êtes libres de choisir le reste.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_09",
      "hash64": "C719BB2A85A18A6B",
      "text": "Cela inclut le choix de votre sac, ou de décider\\nde porter un chapeau, ou non.\\c\\nVous pouvez aussi vous coiffer comme\\nbon vous semble.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_10",
      "hash64": "C71D382A85A494A9",
      "text": "Lorsque j’étais moi-même étudiant, une coupe\\ncomme celle de monsieur Salvio n’aurait\\r\\njamais été autorisée par le règlement.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_11",
      "hash64": "C71D372A85A492F6",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, puisqu’on en parle...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_12",
      "hash64": "C71D362A85A49143",
      "text": "Il y a autre chose que les élèves d’aujourd’hui\\naiment personnaliser, à part leur tenue !\\c\\nJe trouve cela charmant, d’ailleurs, mais le nom\\nm’échappe... Voyez-vous de quoi je parle ?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 184,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_07_select_01",
      "hash64": "11BD2B040E261532",
      "text": "Nos bureaux de classe ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_07_select_02",
      "hash64": "11BD2A040E26137F",
      "text": "Nos chambres ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_07_select_03",
      "hash64": "11BD29040E2611CC",
      "text": "Nos Motismart ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "F71E5FAC71D8F254",
      "text": "Mais enfin, vous voyez bien qu’il n’y a pas\\nde décoration particulière sur vos bureaux.\\c\\nNon, ce n’est pas cela. Je pensais à cet appareil\\npetit et mignon, là...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "F71E62AC71D8F76D",
      "text": "Vous vous doutez bien que la décoration\\nde vos chambres ne me regarde pas, voyons !\\c\\nNon, ce n’est pas cela. Je pensais à cet appareil\\npetit et mignon, là...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "F71E61AC71D8F5BA",
      "text": "Oui, voilà ! C’est de ce petit appareil que\\nje parlais ! Je l’avais sur le bout de la langue ![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_13",
      "hash64": "C71D352A85A48F90",
      "text": "Le Motismart ! Je m’en souviens, maintenant !\\nJe vais tâcher de ne plus oublier son nom.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_14",
      "hash64": "C71D3C2A85A49B75",
      "text": "... Comment ? La boutique qui s’appelle Rézo\\nCadoizo vend des coques pour Motismart ?\\c\\nJe vois... C’est fascinant ![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_15",
      "hash64": "C71D3B2A85A499C2",
      "text": "Je vous remercie pour cette précieuse\\ninformation...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_16",
      "hash64": "C71D3A2A85A4980F",
      "text": "Je m’y rendrai demain à la première heure,\\nafin de me procurer une coque à mon goût.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_17",
      "hash64": "C71D392A85A4965C",
      "text": "Hum... Je vous prie de bien vouloir m’excuser...\\nJe digresse...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_18",
      "hash64": "C71D402A85A4A241",
      "text": "Bon ! Nous arrivons à la fin de nos cours\\nensemble. J’espère que les tâches de la vie\\r\\nquotidienne vous paraissent moins compliquées !\\c\\nJe souhaiterais conclure sur un dernier message\\nau sujet de ma matière : l’éducation domestique.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 236,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_19",
      "hash64": "C71D3F2A85A4A08E",
      "text": "Comme vous le savez, cette matière n’aura pas\\nautant d’impact sur votre avenir professionnel\\r\\nque vos résultats en maths, par exemple.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_20",
      "hash64": "C7203E2A85A6D4B2",
      "text": "Cependant, nous devons tous choisir nos\\nvêtements chaque matin, préparer à manger\\r\\nou encore prendre soin de nos Pokémon...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_21",
      "hash64": "C7203F2A85A6D665",
      "text": "Ce serait un honneur si mes leçons pouvaient\\nenrichir, ne serait-ce qu’un peu, votre vie.\\c\\nJe crois que cela rejoint la pensée de monsieur\\nHassa au sujet de son propre cours...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_22",
      "hash64": "C7203C2A85A6D14C",
      "text": "Je vous remercie donc sincèrement d’avoir\\nprêté attention à mes modestes enseignements.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_g_07_home_23",
      "hash64": "C7203D2A85A6D2FF",
      "text": "Mon cours est désormais terminé. Je compte sur\\nvous pour préparer au mieux le contrôle final.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
